      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 560,
        "height": 1160,
        "content": "## SEO Keyword → Blog Article + Featured Image → WordPress\n\n### How it works\nSubmit a target keyword through the built-in form. An AI model writes a\ncomplete, SEO-optimized article, then Canvora designs a matching **featured\nimage** and **Open Graph card** – on brand, in your colors and fonts. The\nfinished post is created as a **WordPress draft** with the image embedded,\nready for you to review and publish.\n\n### Setup steps\n- Create a free Canvora account at canvora.ai – free credits, no card – and\n  copy an API key from Integrations → API Keys (available on all plans).\n- In each Canvora HTTP Request node, add a **Header Auth** credential:\n  name `X-API-Key`, value your `vd_...` key.\n- Add your OpenAI credential to the \"Write SEO Article\" node (swap for Claude\n  or Gemini if you prefer).\n- Connect your WordPress site credential.\n- Open the form URL from the trigger node and submit a keyword to test.\n\n### Customization\n- Add `blog_header` or an `instagram_post` to `outputFormats` for a fuller\n  social kit (100+ formats: GET https://api.canvora.ai/api/formats).\n- Pass a `brandId` (GET /api/brands) to lock every visual to your brand kit.\n- Swap the form trigger for a Google Sheets or Airtable row to run a keyword\n  queue on a schedule.\n- Cost: 2 visuals = 20 credits per article.\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
